    "note": "16-digit MOT string per WI-2029 (SEL-311L-0,-6 relay Model Option Table). Positions 6-16 are the configurable digits. Position 11 (Secondary Input Voltage) is a fixed '2', and the trailing Conformal Coat digit (position 16) is often omitted on the nameplate/PARTNO string (the SEL-311L-0,-6 IM sample PARTNO 0311L0HDD4254XX is 15 chars, ending at the Communications Protocol digit). Firmware digit (position 6) selects the model variant: 0/6 are the WI-2029 -0/-6 relay; 1/7 are the -1/-7 relay (WI-5857) which shares this position layout but adds Failover Ethernet / IEC 61850 options not enumerated here. This device has no drawing layers (model_to_layers.has_layers = false); positions were calibrated against the real IM PARTNO and the WI-2029 Model Option Table, and independently corroborated by the model_to_drawings position_7 (mounting), position_8/9 (Channel X/Y comms media), and position_14 (I/O board) selectors.",
